flowchart LR
  change{k3s config<br/>changed?}
  change -->|no| noop([No restart])
  change -->|yes| s1
  subgraph loop["serial: 1, one server at a time"]
    direction TB
    s1[Restart k3s<br/>on this server] --> api[Wait for its API server<br/>includes its etcd]
    api --> ready[Wait for the node<br/>to be Ready]
    ready --> pause[Pause before<br/>the next server]
  end
  pause -->|next server| s1
  pause --> done([etcd kept quorum<br/>the whole time])

  class change gov
  class noop,done muted
  class s1,ready net
  class api data
  class pause gov
  class loop z-gov
